High-Level Project Description
------------------------------
This project is a native PHP PDF toolkit for PHP 8.2+.

Core supported areas at this point:
- Generate PDFs from scratch
- Import existing PDFs
- Modify imported PDFs
- Overlay text/shapes/content onto imported pages
- Work with AcroForm fields
- Handle images and color spaces
- Embed and subset fonts
- Support practical Unicode text output
- Support practical shaping coverage short of HarfBuzz-class shaping
- Support Standard Security encrypted PDF import/export through the implemented RC4/AES paths
- Provide a higher-level layout layer including flowing text, panels, and tables

The project explicitly discloses that it was created completely with AI assistance through Codex.

