The codebase was reviewed for modern PHP OOP best-practice alignment.

Changes made:
- Static-only helper/facade classes were made explicitly non-instantiable by adding private constructors where appropriate.
- `Importer` was changed to accept a `PdfParser` dependency through its constructor instead of always hard-coding `new PdfParser()`.
- A test was added to verify explicit parser injection on `Importer`.

This was intentionally kept conservative because the codebase was already fairly modern in structure.

